com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/882\r\n* build(deps): bump node from 25-alpine to 26-alpine by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/845\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 4.0.0 to 4.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/855\r\n* build(deps): bump github/codeql-action from 4.35.2 to 4.36.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/862\r\n* build(deps): bump esbuild and tsx by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/863\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6.0.2 to 7.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/867\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump typescript-eslint from 8.59.1 to 8.60.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/857\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump eslint from 10.2.1 to 10.4.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/859\r\n* test: add regression coverage for relaxed header values by @ShogunPanda in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/898\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @savashn made their first contribution in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/868\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/compare/v9.4.3...v9.4.4","mentions_count":4}